WEBVTT

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:39.240
The leading court physician, Tou-roushi, together with the other top palace physicians,

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:44.570
searched hard for a cure to the strange illness that had appeared in Sashuu.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.030
Kashin, who had written this vast trove of medical books,

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:56.960
was a man famous since childhood for being a genius from the Ka family, the clan of the legendary doctor Kada.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:03.230
In addition, Kashin is the foster father that To Eigetsu dearly loves and knows as Doushu-sama.

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:07.560
Is this it?

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:08.570
Have you found it?

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:13.020
The location, the circumstances, the incubation period and symptoms, they are all here!

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.620
Amazing! It even describes the route of infection and methods of prevention.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:21.480
This is...

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:28.020
surgery on humans...

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.300
You can't perform the treatments?

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:43.300
Could you please tell me the reason?

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.310
This illness is caused by a worm.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:47.530
A worm?

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:49.150
According to this description,

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:55.120
the snow foxes living in the uplands of the Senri Mountains appear to be the carriers of the worms.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.890
The most likely cause of a mass outbreak

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:03.840
is that the snow foxes drop feces containing worm eggs into the wells and rivers,

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.320
and people drink the contaminated water without realizing it.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:07.500
Water?

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:13.960
The eggs in the water hatch in your body and develop, and then you fall ill?

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.050
Yes.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:19.300
There are other illnesses in which worms enter the body, aren't there?

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:21.250
Can't you treat it with a vermifuge?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:27.720
With this illness, vermifuges and other medicines have almost no effect.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.730
There must be some way...

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.030
Are you saying there is no treatment, even in that medical book?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.500
There is one possibility.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:37.450
What is it?

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.480
Surgery on humans.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:48.590
S-Surgery on humans... you don't mean... cutting open the belly?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.130
Just kidding...

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.660
Precisely, I mean the "Just kidding" part.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.710
B-But what are you going to do after you open the belly?

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.350
You can't live with your belly cut open!

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:01.670
If I've torn my sleeve, Shunki will stitch it up for me, but...

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:08.560
Seriously, you really mean to sew the incision back together?!

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.830
Even a fish dies once you cut it open!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.720
It doesn't come back to life after being stitched up!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.010
You stitch the patient up before he dies.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:20.230
But Tou-roushi, earlier you said that you can't treat the victims.  Why is that?

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:22.970
The technique is too advanced.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:27.990
Human surgery carries a high risk.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:38.250
The inventor of human surgery is said to be Kada-roushi.

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:43.500
In the Ka family, numerous secrets related to human surgery have been passed down through generations,

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:48.190
and the inheritor of this knowledge,
the one who wrote this book, is Kashin.

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.840
However, Kashin has already...

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:56.340
Tou-roushi, you mentioned before that you had witnessed Kashin-san's surgical technique, correct?

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.430
Yes, I have indeed seen it.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:02.400
So, you can perform surgery on humans?

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:06.630
As I am now, with my blurred eyesight and shaking hands,

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.030
it's impossible for me to perform surgery on humans.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.570
Isn't there anyone else? Even a rumor, anything!

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:17.500
I might know someone!

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:21.140
It's a doctor who travels around the country.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:23.660
I don't know where he is nowadays...

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:24.960
Is that perhaps...

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.380
The greatest doctor of the present era...

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:31.300
The great wandering doctor who never stays in one place.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.970
Wh-What is his name?

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:41.690
Out of my way!

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.250
Huh? Shuurei-dono.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.660
You seem to be in a real hurry, but...

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.070
Shou-Taishi, excuse me, and see you later!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:59.960
It's been a while, Shuurei-jouchan.  Have you been well?

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.960
You-sensei!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:10.220
When that idiot Shou called me, I wondered what was going on.

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:22.180
Since I was little, he's often taken care of me, but...

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:27.420
Who would've thought that You-sensei was the legendary doctor?

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:38.170
Really, human beings never give up their will to survive.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:40.240
Nothing.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.480
So, can you do it?

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.270
Well, yes, I can.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.000
So, you will perform the art of surgery on humans?

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:51.390
If it is Jouchan's request, I cannot refuse to undertake the task.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:52.630
You-sensei!

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:56.890
However, obtaining the needed instruments could be difficult...

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:00.230
I have only a few myself.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.970
Since I'd have to let complete amateurs use them...

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.530
D-Don't tell me we have to do it as well?

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:10.200
Are you saying I have to treat dozens of people on my own?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.150
Be considerate to the elderly!

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.280
You're all coming to Sashuu as well, aren't you?

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.780
Ah, well, but...

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.170
You spoiled brats!

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:22.620
Tou-roushi!

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:27.050
Why hesitate? Are you going to waste the chance to study the greatest medical technique of this era?

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:31.720
You brats! Give me your youth, and I'll go instead of you!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.830
Please calm down, Master.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:37.520
You! As a doctor, how much will you be able to learn?

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.810
This is the only opportunity...

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.770
I know. I'm going!

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.970
That's right. We never said we weren't going.

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:47.510
We are direct apprentices of Tou-roushi.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:50.910
You kids...

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.470
Please guide us.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.830
Fine, then we'll go to the kitchen first.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:05.910
You should first practice cutting on pigs and things like that.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.010
Pigs?

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:12.110
Given the situation, we don't have much time.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:14.010
Don't expect to have time to sleep.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.340
So, the problem here is...

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.850
The instruments you're worried about are these thin scalpels described here?

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:21.610
That's right.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:27.650
"The scalpel should be sharp enough that even doctors unfamiliar with knives can cut a man cleanly..."

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:32.780
"To lessen the impact on patients with reduced strength, the thinner the blade the better..."

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:35.840
Is it possible to make them, Rin?

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:39.330
As an inventor, I will undertake the task with pride.

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:42.920
I want at least 200 scalpels, including the ones needed for practice.

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.590
Understood.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.710
Well, my dear, Governor Kou,

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.430
please gather as many master swordsmiths as you can in two days.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.840
The Merchants Guild has many good swordsmiths.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.210
I will start work immediately on the design calculations.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:08:59.120
See you.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.350
They can be saved. We can save them.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.410
What remains to be done is...

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.000
Medicine, isn't it, You-sensei?

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:14.240
That's right. The supply is not at all sufficient.
If possible, get acupuncturists and more doctors too.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:18.360
Tou-roushi, what value would you place on this medical book?

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:23.250
It is worth more than ten thousand in gold, but it is more valuable than mere money.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:28.860
So if a person understands the value of this book, they'd die for it, correct?

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.000
You are correct.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.870
I'm borrowing one of the books...

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.640
and I'd like to borrow You-sensei's name as well.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:40.720
Ah, I'm a shy man, but there's no other way...

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.140
I, as head of the Sa family, will write a letter as well!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.250
Please do.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.020
Yuushun-san.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:50.380
Leave the Imperial Court to me.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.520
I'll stall the high government officials until the last minute.

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:55.150
I'm relying on you.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:01.530
Luck is on your side, Shuurei-jouchan. That's very important.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:04.240
Yes!

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.760
Just hang in there, Eigetsu.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:31.020
I'll definitely come with the princess to help you.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.070
So stay alive until then, for Kourin-jouchan!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:41.230
Doushu-sama!

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:15.060
Yougetsu... Yougetsu! Yougetsu!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:18.570
Let him live! You can have what is left of my life!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.470
I don't care how you do it! Bring him back!

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:34.920
Don't get me wrong.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.440
This is Eigetsu's wish.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.210
This is not my doing.

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:43.150
Eigetsu won't last long,

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.930
so show your courage and take care of him until the time comes.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.080
Even if it's just for few years, live up to it.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.530
For Eigetsu.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:02.670
I must hurry!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.200
I've run out of time!

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:21.440
Are things going well?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:25.270
An urgent conference will be held at court tomorrow.

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:27.160
Oujo-sama has gone to the Merchants Guild?

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.510
On her own, I hear.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:31.510
On her own?

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:36.920
Once her task in Kiyou is over, she'll depart immediately, won't she?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:41.530
No matter how dangerous it is, oujo-sama will leave for sure.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:44.060
"Don't go..." I can say that.

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:46.280
I have the power to stop her too...

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.410
but Shuurei wouldn't want that.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.910
It would be such a relief if we could say, "Don't go."

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:55.650
Bro-

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:02.660
Your Highness, Officer Tei has been looking for you for a while.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:03.920
I see.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.960
Governor Kou, please come this way.

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:23.640
Yes.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:32.460
The Governor of Sashuu, Governor Kou, has arrived.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.420
To come here alone...

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.830
She has great courage.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.930
Governor Kou, what business brings you here so late at night?

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.560
Let's make a deal.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:55.060
A deal?

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:59.660
Sashuu prefecture would like to make a temporary contract

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:03.820
with doctors, pharmacists, and acupuncturists affiliated with the Merchants Guild.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.820
The more there are, the better.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.690
The key condition is that they must depart within four days for Koringun, in Sashuu.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.280
The contract will be for at least a few months.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.200
They don't need to be from the Kiyou Merchants Guild.

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:18.450
If there are doctors near Sashuu who can depart immediately, that would be even more helpful.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.840
Is there an outbreak of disease in Koringun?

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.460
Yes, and we lack sufficient manpower.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.400
Of course, we will cover all costs.

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:28.980
Is it an epidemic?

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.850
It cannot pass from person to person.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.180
The season for new infections is over too.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:37.100
We have all required information about the disease, including methods of prevention.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.870
What we lack are the doctors to treat the patients.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:43.420
Do excuse me, but the sum of money required would be very high.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.860
Can Sashuu pay up right now?

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:50.740
In fact, as a part of this deal, I have one more request.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:55.750
By the day after tomorrow, we would like you to gather a group of skilled swordsmiths.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:56.740
Swordsmiths?

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.070
The treatment entails surgery on humans.

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:02.220
S-Surgery on humans?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:08.210
At this moment, Sai Rin-san is designing a special scalpel for operating on humans.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:13.630
By the third day, we need to make 200 scalpels in a day.

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:18.520
You talk about surgery on humans so casually, but is it possible?

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:24.360
Sashuu prefecture has fortunately been able to employ the legendary doctor You Shikou.

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:28.660
I-Is that true?

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:29.530
Yes.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.650
The dispatch of a medical team from the Imperial Court has been confirmed,

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:38.160
and currently, Doctor You{she only uses You-sensei when addressing him directly} is giving lessons on human surgical techniques at the palace.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:43.220
That doctor You Shikou is providing instruction on human surgery himself?!

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:44.370
Indeed.

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:48.300
In other words, the doctors who show up at Koringun, no matter who they are,

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:52.800
will be able to learn Doctor You's techniques for surgery on humans, and his secret arts.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:59.220
Kouson-dono, I'm heading to the palace with my apprentices immediately.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:03.630
Who would have thought that such an opportunity would come in my lifetime!

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:09.390
As head of the medical department, I'd advise you to accept this deal immediately!

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:12.840
The knowledge and techniques cannot be valued monetarily!

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:17.390
I see, the knowledge and techniques are part of the payment.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:19.080
Is that what you're saying?

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:23.600
I will make one more effort and show you our treasure.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:28.420
Do you know a person named Kashin? A descendant of Kada.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.220
It can't be!

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:36.580
That is Ka-Ka-Ka family's, Ka...

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:40.850
For various reasons, I have personally been put in charge of this book.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:44.760
The head court physician, Tou-roushi, looked at this book and commented,

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:47.350
"It is worth more than ten thousand in gold."

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.740
The causes of all types of illnesses,
preventative measures, treatments,

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:55.360
and an enormous list of prescriptions for new medicines are contained in this book.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:01.370
By the way, this is only one of dozens of books.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:03.770
So frankly speaking,

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.320
don't you want this?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:19.200
Your condition for giving those books to us is

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.790
that we dispatch our affiliated doctors to Koringun, is that correct?

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:23.720
No.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:29.040
To treat the illness in Koringun, a number of these books will be needed.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:33.920
The doctors and pharmacists going to Koringun will have to read this book.

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:36.740
What are you trying to say?

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:41.090
For that reason, this medical book, and a few others, aren't included in the proposed terms.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:46.500
All necessary expenses will be paid in a lump sum by the government.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.630
Then what was your intention in showing us the book?

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:54.650
If you want to judge the quality of this book, please come to Koringun!

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:55.520
That's what I'm saying.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:18:00.630
If you had a glimpse of the book while treating people and wanted to read the other books,

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:03.080
for prescriptions of new drugs,

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:06.040
or to learn new medical treatments, then...

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:20.650
I have underestimated you a little.

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:24.740
Given that we have acknowledged the value of those books,

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:30.690
in exchange for the contents, you'd like us to provide funds for establishing schools, wouldn't you?

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:35.970
Using these books, we can attract doctors and scholars to the school,

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:41.760
where they can perform research and develop new drugs and treatments.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.930
The Merchants Guild will have top priority,

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:49.270
or an exclusive right, to the mass production and marketing of the new drugs.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:55.920
If you say you aren't interested, I'll have to approach other merchant houses.

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:03.280
Oh, you were slightly tempted just now, weren't you?

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:08.200
If you were tempted even a little, then I will show you another of my cards.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.790
You have more to say?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:17.720
It would not be surprising if To Eigetsu and I were dismissed once this is over.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.550
We have ignored numerous rules and forced our way forward.

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:25.180
You are risking your own career for this incident?

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:29.160
Well, it was bound to happen sooner or later.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:33.940
Establishing the school I have talked to you about will take time.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:39.170
Implementation of such a long-term agenda will only start when a new governor is appointed.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:50.140
The current Governor of Kokushuu, Kai Yu, has agreed to be the next Governor of Sashuu.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:53.840
He has promised me that he will implement all my plans.

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:57.550
This is written and signed by him.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.540
Kai Yu?! That...

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.800
The most famous officer of our time?

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:04.880
This is indeed Kai Yu-sama's handwriting.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.680
So you came with all your cards prepared.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.370
You've become quite interested.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:12.900
I'm glad I showed you that card.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.500
You'll feel reassured if it's Kai Yu-sama, rather than a greenhorn governor, right?

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:18.560
Yes.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:22.720
Wow, you say that so bluntly! Well, it's true though...

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:26.730
In addition, I also have a letter from the head of the Sa family.

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:28.880
Please consider it with the other letter.

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.330
Excuse me.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:33.310
Letters have arrived for Kouson-sama and the Governor of Sashuu.

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:36.580
I was told that they are urgent.

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.090
Hawk mail?

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:53.360
I've received an angry letter from Sai Shou in Sashuu, instructing me to send all the medicine I have immediately.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:56.200
To send a letter with the hawk stamp,

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:58.480
the situation must be extremely bad.

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:00.460
Sai Shou-san did?

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.790
This letter is from Officer Tei.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:10.870
An enormous amount of funding has been set aside for this incident.

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:11.990
Also...

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:18.530
"If the Merchants Guild delays the matter, I will make them work for free."

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.670
Written and signed by the Emperor himself.

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:26.330
You were... waiting for this?

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:32.260
During this emergency, you deliberately brought up the topic of establishing the school to gain time!

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:36.730
It's all right. You can claim that you made your decision before this letter arrived.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:39.640
In that case, we can still pay you legitimately.

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:43.060
I'd be delighted, though, if you'd add something extra because I've done you a favor.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:50.320
Or, based on humanitarian grounds,
would you kindly volunteer to help for free?

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.840
Wh-Why am I being laughed at?

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:04.360
We've been completely outwitted.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:08.400
Kouson, we better take whatever we can now and get on with it.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:12.350
Rather than working for free, it's better that we give her something extra.

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:15.350
Let's go to the palace and learn human surgery!

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:18.030
Fair enough.

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:21.350
We will undertake all your requests.

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:27.860
As an extra, in exchange for ignoring that letter,

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:31.860
we promise that we will be in Koringun within half a month.

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:33.370
Half a month?

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:34.620
Wouldn't it take at least a month?

00:22:34.970 --> 00:22:37.310
A merchant should be prompt at everything.

00:22:37.310 --> 00:22:38.840
That is our principle.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:40.620
There are a number of ways.

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:42.880
That would be the best bonus I could get!

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:46.130
Once the Merchants Guild makes a deal,

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:50.970
we do our best to satisfy our customer and to protect our reputation.

00:22:51.460 --> 00:22:55.050
We promise you that we will not fail to meet your expectations.

00:22:57.320 --> 00:22:58.730
Thank you very much.

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:07.400
Wow... it's daybreak already.

00:23:12.610 --> 00:23:14.340
"There's an urgent invitation for a court conference."

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:17.420
"Please return after persuading the Merchants Guild."

00:23:19.400 --> 00:23:21.700
Now, this will be the last great task.

00:24:45.870 --> 00:24:47.760
I have the co-operation of the Merchants Guild now.

00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:50.810
What remains are the high officials at court, who are as obstinate as mules.

00:24:51.160 --> 00:24:52.600
So here comes the great task!

00:24:52.600 --> 00:24:56.350
To save the people of Sashuu, I'm going to persuade them, no matter what!
